    <description>Activity Management V1 — Opportunity Agent create_activity action target. Creates a single Task or Event linked to an Opportunity (whatId), branching strictly on activityType. Activity creation only: no deal, company, or interaction-intelligence logic. User confirmation is enforced upstream by the .agent create_activity action (require_user_confirmation: True), not by this Flow.</description>
